Description: Time travel for your files in GNOME, with BorgBackup
 Delta shows how a file or a folder looked on any day, from Nautilus or its
 own window, and restores it. Copies are made by BorgBackup (incremental,
 deduplicated and encrypted) and stay on this computer, in a folder or on a
 connected drive. Passwords are kept in the GNOME secret service and the
 schedule runs with systemd user timers.
